                ✔ FIX: RandomShutoff burden permanently neutered on AutoPowerOn modules
                   @done(26-08-14) (found in a solo smoke-test log after the UpgradeForgeBehavior
                   split: Module_Buildable_PowerGenerator_03 logged "shutoff DECLINED by a
                   ChangeValidator" every retry interval, forever. ROOT CAUSE: vanilla
                   PowerDrain.ValidatePowerTurnOff (Gameplay.Power/PowerDrain.cs:175) vetoes any
                   turn-off request when AutoPowerOn && CanTurnOn() — true for Power Generators
                   and presumably other self-powering modules. RandomShutoffBehavior reschedules
