                   burdens log once via LogDebug so the exclusion is visible, not silent.
                   FIX #2 (stop the spam regardless): RequestPowerOff's onFail now logs only the
                   first decline per power-cycle (_loggedDecline, reset in OnPowerStateChanged) —
