                       RETESTED AGAIN — ContinuousDynamic made no difference. User confirmed via
                       Runtime Unity Editor (already loaded as a BepInEx plugin) live-inspecting the
                       spawned box: it doesn't land on a lower deck, doesn't get destroyed — it just
