                       likely: residual velocity (e.g. inherited player/ship momentum at spawn) with
                       nothing providing collision or drag to stop it, consistent with the box never
                       actually being connected into MovingSpacePlatform's simulated PhysicsScene at
                       all (separate PhysicsScenes never collide with each other regardless of
                       collision detection mode — a structural reason no physics-tuning fix could
                       have worked).
